            "title": "Paramount-Warner Bros., Amazon & Google, Apple: Trending Tickers",
            "description": "<p>Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Paramount Skydance's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PSKY\">PSKY</a>) reported plan to put in a bid for Warner Bros. Discovery (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WBD\">WBD</a>), the Federal Trade Commission's (FTC) probe into the search advertising practices of Amazon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) and Alphabet's Google (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>), and Apple (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>) delaying its Chinese launch date for<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/apple-debuts-superthin-iphone-air-alongside-iphone-17-and-iphone-17-pro-181527722.html\"> its iPhone Air.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
